{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>From Chinnereth.</b> From the western side of the Jordan — and the inheritance of the children of Gad was from the eastern side of the Jordan. The width of the Jordan opposite them fell into their lot, and further, from beyond its bank to Chinnereth. This is what is meant by <b>and the Jordan and the border</b> — the Jordan and what is across from it."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:45:48.108743550Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}